discipline technologies. Perform other duties as required. REQUIREMENTS: Earned Doctorate (PhD, DBA) in Business Administration, or Doctorate (PhD, DBA) in a business-related field from an accredited institution with Business Administration related industry experience OR Master’s degree in business administration related field in combination with appropriate industry experience. 1-3 or more years of teaching experience in higher education, on-ground and on-line, preferred Professional written and verbal communication skills; Candidates should have an affinity to the mission of the university. Must be eligible to work in the United States without sponsorship.     TO APPLY:  Submit a cover letter, resume and contact information for at least three current professional references.  Saint Mary is an Equal Opportunity Employer.  Questions: email human resources at  hr@stmary.edu",
