istration, or Doctorate (PhD, DBA) in a business marketing-related field from an accredited institution with Business Administration related industry experience OR  Master’s degree in Marketing or Marketing-related field in combination with appropriate industry experience. At least two years of full-time (or full-time equivalent) teaching experience in higher education. Professional written and verbal communication skills. Additionally, candidates should have an affinity to the mission of the university. Must be eligible to work in the United States without sponsorship.       TO APPLY: Submit a cover letter, resume and contact information for at least three current professional references.  Saint Mary is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Questions: email human resources at  hr@stmary.edu",
